From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Patrizio Bekerle <patrizio@bekerle.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 10:11:08 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add option to show all chats in the Home space

When enabled, Home lists direct chats and rooms from every space, keeps Home
selected while opening chats, and includes direct chat notifications in its
badge. Use three mutually exclusive radio options for the Home space settings,
preserving the existing settings.

Backport of commits 91132e1b6fd8628ebc4035f8588d888dcc2c9fc2 and
c9611dcffb3f8d8a60049a59460d568225560858 from
https://invent.kde.org/network/neochat/-/merge_requests/3087 to 26.08.
